WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.800
I will tell you, at the end of the day,

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.460
when I ask my kids an

3
00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:04.810
example of when they were kind,

4
00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:06.460
it's very helpful for me to share

5
00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:07.870
an example of when I was kind.

6
00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:09.580
And when I reflect on the day

7
00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:11.020
and I find that I don't have

8
00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:12.830
that many examples, I'm embarrassed.

9
00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:15.500
I have found that as a dad,

10
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:16.960
what I want for my kids

11
00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:18.780
is slightly different than the way

12
00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:19.830
I show up in the world.

13
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.520
And I think that a relatively

14
00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:25.280
unhealthy thing for me to do

15
00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:26.160
would be to ignore that.

16
00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:28.370
I look back on my life,

17
00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:30.180
turns out I did what my dad said.

18
00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:31.560
If I reflect on the type of person I am,

19
00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:33.370
I'm more similar to what he did.

20
00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:35.320
I'm pretty confident the kids

21
00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:36.980
are picking up what I do

22
00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:39.090
in equal parts with what I say.

23
00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:40.840
If I don't endeavor to be

24
00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.290
better at the things I do,

25
00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:45.410
how much curiosity and persistence is actually there

26
00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:46.220
if I'm not curious

27
00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:48.870
and persistent to improve myself, you know?
